      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/reagan_oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Pennington Creek supports the local environment and contributes to the larger watershed of the Red River basin.",
